            "block_content": "as required by law for all coordinators and designated Union officers by no later than February 28, 1998, and in the future as needed. If an employee successfully completes the ReachOut Program and has not tested positive for the four-year period set forth in the agreement he or she has signed, then if such employee again tests positive under a For Cause Drug Test, the event will be considered as a \"first instance\" as set forth above.",
